return {
    ["\n帕里克：\n\n　　你还好吗？前几天我和菲丽丝一起，回了趟科诺桑小镇。\n布兰登先生还是老样子，在镍币书店教孩子们读书，和当时教我们识字一样。\n　　你最近怎么样？什么时候回来看看？我们很想你。"] = "\nPalik:\n\n　　Are you okay? A few days ago, Phyllis and I went back to Konoson Small Town.\nMr. Brandon is still the same, teaching children to read at the Nickel Bookstore, just like when he taught us to read back then.\n　　How have you been lately? When will you come back to visit? We miss you very much.",
    ["       真是件神奇的事情，一个异想天开的实验和一个偶然出现的失误，让我发现了一位困于风暴之中、迷失于黑暗深处的可怜家伙，他甚至只能在每个月满月的时候才能稍微靠近现实世界，可依然无法将他的呼喊传递进来。\r\n\r\n       他是幸运的，他遇见了我——这个时代的主角。\r\n\r\n       写完上面这段话，自己读了一遍，忽然有点唏嘘，哪怕是用汉字，也不知不觉带上了浓烈的翻译腔，四十年弹指一挥间啊，以往的记忆真的就像梦一样了。"] = "       It is truly a miraculous thing. A whimsical experiment and an accidental error led me to discover a poor fellow trapped in a storm, lost in the depths of darkness. He can only approach the real world slightly during the full moon each month, yet he still cannot get his cries to carry through.\r\n\r\n       He is fortunate; he met me—the protagonist of this era.\r\n\r\n       After writing the passage above and reading it to myself, I suddenly felt a bit wistful. Even when using Chinese, I unconsciously adopted a heavy translation tone. Forty years have passed in the blink of an eye; past memories really feel just like a dream.",
