    ["开启获得1个<Highlight>绑定</>的灰雾尘埃。每周可开启<Highlight>3</>次，未开启的次数将累计至下一周，至多累计至<Highlight>15</>次。\n\n<Highlight>灰雾尘埃</>：铸造神话品质胸针<Highlight>（冒险倾向）</>的关键材料。\n\n铸造需消耗<Highlight>15</>个灰雾尘埃，得到64装等<Highlight>冒险倾向</>神话品质胸针。\n随赛季进程，将开放冒险倾向神话胸针的装等提升，提升时消耗一定数量的<Highlight>灰雾尘埃</>。\n\n每周可通过队伍副本、团队副本、世界冒险秘宝<Highlight>直接获取</>至多<Highlight>3</>个灰雾尘埃。未获取个数可累计至下周，至多累计至<Highlight>15</>个。"] = "Open to obtain 1 <Highlight>bound</> gray fog dust. You can open it <Highlight>3</> times per week; unused attempts will accumulate to the following week, up to a maximum of <Highlight>15</> times. \n\n<Highlight>Gray fog dust</>: A key material for forging Mythical quality brooches <Highlight>(Adventure-oriented)</>. \n\nForging requires <Highlight>15</> gray fog dust to obtain a Gear Level 64 <Highlight>Adventure-oriented</> Mythical quality brooch. \nAs the season progresses, Gear Level Increase for Adventure-oriented Mythical brooches will be unlocked, which will consume a certain amount of <Highlight>gray fog dust</>. \n\nYou can directly obtain up to <Highlight>3</> gray fog dust per week through party dungeons, raid dungeons, and world adventure treasures <Highlight>directly obtained</>. Unobtained amounts can accumulate to the following week, up to a maximum of <Highlight>15</>.",
