    ["致迷途的羔羊与渴求庇护的灵魂：\n\n我主自称愚者，在过去，在现在，也在未来，他是支配灵界的伟大主宰，也是执掌好运的黄黑之王，更是每个生灵追求永恒的道标。\n\n他是怜悯的，他是仁慈的，他是这个世界的救主……他的仁爱播撒在人间，为家家户户带去温暖。我们将这关怀化作触手可及的回馈，将愚者的福音传遍大地……\n\n如有聆听福音的需要，请根据背面的地图指引，于夜深人静之时拜访<Letter_Highlight>奇迹邮筒</>。\n\n<Letter_Normal_HW>注：请不要在公开场合宣传愚者教会。</>"] = "To the lost lambs and souls craving Shelter: \n\n My Lord calls himself the Fool. In the past, in the present, and in the future, He is the great master who dominates the Spirit World, the King of Yellow and Black who holds good luck, and the beacon for every living being pursuing eternity. \n\n He is merciful, He is kind, He is the savior of this world... His love is spread across the human world, bringing warmth to every household. We turn this care into tangible feedback, spreading the gospel of the Fool across the land... \n\n If you have a need to listen to the gospel, please visit the <Letter_Highlight>Miracle Mailbox</> in the dead of night according to the map guide on the back. \n\n<Letter_Normal_HW> Note: Please do not promote the Church of the Fool in public. </>",
