    ["高产的小麦、肥硕的鱼群……丰饶树的力量为金秋小镇造成困扰，也意外地打响了小镇“农业模范”的名号。\n每逢开学季，鲁恩王国各大农学院的学生总会前往小镇学习，一些关于丰饶树的奇妙言论也开始蔓延，逐渐到了无人不知的地步：\n“用丰饶树保佑过的肥料种地，作物营养不流失也不蒸发，简直一袋能顶两袋洒！”\n从金秋小镇回来的学生为种出的作物惊叹。到了期末，冲向丰饶树的就是另一批学生了。\n湖畔堆满了学生的论文，灿金色的枝叶下，有稀疏的花椰菜，蔫巴巴的鱼，甚至躺在担架上、昏迷不醒的人，同行人扑通一声跪倒在地，向丰饶树大喊：“救命！我室友被自己种了四年的论文毒倒了！”\n“丰饶树啊！求你保佑我室友，让他的小麦变成无毒的品种吧！”"] = "High-yielding wheat, fat schools of fish... The power of the Tree of Abundance caused trouble for Golden Autumn Small Town, but also unexpectedly made the town famous as an \"agricultural model.\" \n Every semester, students from major agricultural colleges in the Loen Kingdom would go to the town to study, and some strange remarks about the Tree of Abundance began to spread, gradually becoming known to everyone: \n \"Using fertilizer blessed by the Tree of Abundance to farm means crops don't lose nutrients or evaporate; one bag is worth two!\" \n Students returning from Golden Autumn Small Town marveled at the crops they grew. By the end of the term, it was another batch of students rushing to the Tree of Abundance. \n The lakeside was piled high with students' theses. Under the golden branches, there were sparse cauliflowers, wilted fish, and even people lying on stretchers in a coma. A companion knelt on the ground with a thud and shouted to the Tree of Abundance: \"Help! My roommate was poisoned by the thesis he's been growing for four years!\" \n \"Oh, Tree of Abundance! Please bless my roommate and turn his wheat into a non-toxic variety!\"",
    ["魔药消化完成后，你感受到一阵奇妙的体验。应该能晋升下个序列了，回黑荆棘看看吧。"] = "After the potion is digested, you feel a wonderful experience. You should be able to advance to the next Sequence; go back to Blackthorn and take a look.",
